  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **First Street > (5:18)**: back after 89 archived shows (1877 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **First Street con't (6:05)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Bobby Byrd * (9:42)**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2008-08-23.schoeps.mk21** (recommended): source not stated; 8 songs; 75 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Soulive Horns joined for the starred songs: Sam Kininger on alto sax and Ryan Zoidis on tenor sax [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2008-08-23.schoeps.mk21**: source: Schoeps mk21 (fob/nos) > Lunatec v2 > 722@24/28 [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps mk21 microphones, front-of-board/near-omni setup, run through a Lunatec v2 into a 722 recorder at 24-bit/28; Transfer went from CF card through Spark XL 2.82 and xACT, ending as FLAC [1]",
